stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Closed : Success() — any reply, including business rejections, resets failures
    Closed --> Open : Failure() × threshold (default 5)<br/>write error · reply timeout · exchange-health error (10028, 10040, 10041, 11051, 13888)
    Open --> Open : Allow() before open period ends → ErrCircuitOpen (low priority only)
    Open --> HalfOpen : open period elapsed (default 60 s)
    HalfOpen --> Closed : Success()
    HalfOpen --> Open : Failure()
    note right of Open
        High-priority requests (stop-loss, kill switch,
        GEX close) are never blocked by the breaker.
    end note
